flowchart TD
    classDef start fill:#0d9488,stroke:#0d9488,color:#ffffff
    classDef act fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#0f172a
    classDef dec fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#0f172a
    classDef sys fill:#f0fdfa,stroke:#0d9488,color:#0f172a
    classDef stop fill:#64748b,stroke:#475569,color:#ffffff
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#0f172a

    A([Start]):::start --> B["Guest browses public menu and offers"]:::act
    B --> C{Wants to order or book?}:::dec
    C -->|No| B
    C -->|Yes| D["Register, becomes Customer"]:::act
    D --> E{Dine in or delivery / takeaway?}:::dec

    E -->|Dine in| F["Customer books reservation (Application)"]:::act
    F --> G["Waiter confirms and assigns table"]:::act
    G --> H["Security verifies reservation_code at entrance"]:::sys
    H --> I{Banned or over capacity?}:::dec
    I -->|Yes| J["Deny entry, escalate to manager"]:::bad
    I -->|No| K["Waiter seats guests, opens order"]:::act

    E -->|Delivery / takeaway| L["Customer places order directly"]:::act
    L --> M["Delivery employee assigned if order_type=Delivery"]:::act

    K --> N["Meal and offer lines added to the order"]:::act
    M --> N
    N --> O["Chef checks ingredient stock and prepares"]:::act
    O --> P{Ingredients short?}:::dec
    P -->|Yes| Q["Meal marked unavailable, manager notified"]:::bad
    P -->|No| R["Order marked Confirmed"]:::act
    Q --> R

    R --> S{Delivery order?}:::dec
    S -->|Yes| T["Delivery employee delivers, marks Completed"]:::act
    S -->|No| U["Waiter serves, marks order Completed"]:::act

    T --> V["Customer rates meals and offers"]:::act
    U --> V
    J --> W([End]):::stop
    V --> X["Manager reviews sales and ratings report"]:::sys
    X --> W
